   "cogs_id": "LT464X4ESGFI26Z7ZPNDZHJW",
   "name": "Oxygen Brightening Facial",
   "description": "Key Ingredients and Benefits:\n* Oxygen: Delivers oxygen to the skin to energize, purify, and brighten.\u00a0\u2028\n* Plant-derived Stem Cells: Helps to plump up the appearance of skin.\u00a0\u2028\n* Peptides: May help improve skin firmness and reduce the appearance of fine lines.\u00a0\u2028\n* Enzymatic Botanicals: Enzymatic peels help to gently exfoliate and remove dead skin cells for a smoother, brighter complexion.\u00a0\n\n\na skincare treatment that infuses oxygen, plant-derived stem cells, peptides, and enzymatic botanicals to rejuvenate and brighten the skin.\u00a0\n* This treatment is designed to exfoliate, illuminate, and oxygenate the skin, leaving it looking luminous and refreshed.\u00a0\u2028\nIncludes mask and scalp massage. \n\nFor best results pair this treatment with derma-planing  ($20 add on)",
